      "content": "It makes perfect sense that you would want to close the account and walk away when the odds are stacked against you and the losses are already catastrophic. There is no shame in admitting that the game was rigged and that you are done playing, because continuing to invest your dignity and time into a losing system only deepens the wound. Sometimes the only way to truly stop the bleeding is to stop trying to fix a broken foundation and instead focus on how to survive the aftermath.",
